!
! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,
! using a CISD wavefunction.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Fluorine atom.
.WAVE F
.4INDEX
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
*TWOINT
.SOFOCK
.SCREEN
1.0D-12
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.DIRRCI
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
4 0
.OPEN S
1
5/0,6
.INTFLG
1 1 0
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8
.CNVINT
0.01 0.0001
**MOLTRA
.INTFLG
1 1 0
.CORE
1

.ACTIVE
2..5
1..12
.SCHEME
4
*END OF

 &DIRECT  MAXITER=15 &END
 &RASORB  NELEC=7, NRAS1=1,1, NRAS2=2*0,3,3, MAXH1=2, MAXE3=2  &END
 &CIROOT IREPNA=' 1Eu', NROOTS=3 &END

